# Vendored third-party modules live here verbatim, so the repo-root rules must
# not eat files the upstream module actually ships. In particular *.gitignore:4*
# excludes *.dll, which silently dropped internal/wintun/*/wintun.dll — files
# that //go:embed requires — and broke the Windows build with
# "pattern amd64/wintun.dll: no matching files found".
!*.dll
